--
N5008 [temp.deduct]/5 + [basic.scope.temp]/2: deduction binds only the
deduced template's own parameters.  An enclosing function template's
same-short-name parameter (P2 = ratio<1,1>, defaulted and undeducible)
used to be substituted into the member converting constructor's deduced
signature (its own P2 = ratio<60,1>) by the flat-map short-name lookup,
deleting the constructor from the overload set and dropping the enclosing
body.  Header-free minimal form of the std::chrono mixed-period
operator+ defect (cpp11_chrono_mixed_duration_add); g++/clang++
runtime-verified.
